msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>Controls resource overbooking when scheduling.</para><para>If "
"overbooking is allowed, a resource may be booked (on working days) to work "
"more than it is available. This can happen if the resource is allocated to "
"multiple tasks or are booked on other projects.</para><para>If overbooking "
"is to be avoided, resources will not be booked more than they are available. "
"On resource conflict, tasks will be delayed until the resource is available."
"</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Controla o uso por riba do posible dos recursos.</para><para>No caso "
"de que se permita sobreempregar recursos os recursos pódense asignar, en "
"días laborais, para estar máis dispoñibles do que se permite. Isto pode "
"acontecer cando o recurso se asigna a varias tarefas ou se marca en varios "
"proxectos.</para><para>No caso de que se evite o sobreemprego de recursos "
"non se permite asignar os recursos por riba do límite. Cando apareza un "
"conflito de recursos o que se fai é retrarar as tarefas ata que o recurso "
"estea dispoñible.</para>"

#: models/kptcommonstrings.cpp:135
msgid "The distribution to be used during scheduling"
msgstr "A distribución a usar durante  a planificación"

#: models/kptcommonstrings.cpp:137
#, fuzzy
#| msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
#| msgid ""
#| "<para>The distribution to be used during scheduling</para><para>If "
#| "distribution is 'None', the tasks estimate is used as is during "
#| "scheduling.</para><para>If distribution is 'PERT', the estimate used is "
#| "calculated based on the entered optimistic- (O), pessimistic-(P) and most "
#| "likely (M) estimate. The formulay used for this is (O + 4 * M + P) / 6."
#| "<para>"
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>The distribution to be used during scheduling</para><para>If "
"distribution is 'None', the tasks estimate is used as is during scheduling.</"
"para><para>If distribution is 'PERT', the estimate used is calculated based "
"on the entered optimistic- (O), pessimistic-(P) and most likely (M) "
"estimate. The formula used for this is (O + 4 * M + P) / 6.<para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>A distribución que se emprega durante o cálculo da axenda</"
"para><para>Se a ditribución é \"Ningunha\" a tarefa estímase tal é como se "
"fai durante a asignación de axenda.</para><para>Se a distribución é \"PERT\" "
"a estimación calcúlase baseandose na estimación optimista (O), pesimista (P) "
"e na máis probable (M). A formula que se emprega para isto é (O + 4*M * P)6."
"<para>"

